#: ../../source/docs/common-can-pmu.rst:5 c6c8625f44ce48169cbdf2922b30d047
msgid "CUAV CAN/DroneCAN Power Module"
msgstr "CUAV CAN/DroneCAN 电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-can-pmu.rst:11 f7bbf5dc8f604595892fcc2f3c87dad0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-can-pmu.rst:13 a17be111f3fa428f85d4fb6b5e76eb12
msgid ""
"CUAV's CAN/DroneCAN PMU is a drone power management module with built-in "
"STM32F4 processor running CUAV's ITT compensation algorithm to accurately "
"measure the voltage and current of the drone's battery. It supports 6~62V "
"voltage input, and the POWER output port can output 5V/ 8A. It uses advanced"
" CAN bus communication and supports the standard `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org/>`__ protocol. Each PMU is factory calibrated to "
"ensure good consistency and high accuracy."
msgstr ""
"CUAV 的 CAN/DroneCAN PMU 是一款无人机电源管理模块，内置 STM32F4 处理器，运行 CUAV 的 ITT "
"补偿算法，精确测量无人机电池的电压和电流。支持 6~62V 电压输入，POWER 输出端口可输出 5V/8A。采用先进的 CAN 总线通信，支持标准 "
"`DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org/>`__ 协议。每个 PMU 均经过出厂校准，确保良好的一致性和高精度。"

